{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】APEC財長會結束，部分代表到故宮文化博物館參觀。</p><p>APEC財長會閉幕後，部分與會代表下午乘坐旅遊巴到達故宮文化博物館。在西九文化區管理局首席財務總監李家文帶領下，參觀約40分鐘後離開。代表團之後會坐船在維多利亞港觀光。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T09:42:06.239604+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T08:03:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T21:18:26.915541+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:37:52.247296+00:00","content_hash":"d954bdb9b8400058dd35608d91f48b0d86e41104dcc713fac659862140df6ab9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}